Z||000000||kinboyatuwo||11-01-2000||12:24 PM||||Does anyone remember knight rider and michel knight?<P>Rember Kit and those awsome lights on the front of the car, well i now have them on the fiero.<BR>Those years in electronics classes has paid off well.  I don't use the lense type just a plain LED pointing throught the Black line on the front, doese the swooping and more.  Made one in a tube and blue for a 98 talon this week, looked pretty cool and the light looked almost liquid like when moving.<P>Just had to brag<P>i am considering a couple more, almost any color with or with out tube<P>email for more info<P>if i can find a way to get some photos i will <P>kinboyatuwo@yahoo.com||||reg||6
