Z||000005||Seanh||11-01-2000||10:37 PM||||I have had somthing like that for a while. It mounts under my rearview mirror and it is blue, 5 segments, Electroluminecent. I tired taking a picture of it but my digital cam tints everything red where there is not enough light. I will look on the manufacturs website tomarrow to see if they have some pictures of it. It is really cool looking. I wired it to a switch on the overhead panel so I can run it while I am driving (big no no but I do it anyway), you would not believe how many people have pulled over when I turn it on, so funny.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I love it when I am eating out and I always try to set by the window to watch my car. People walking by start looking at that light and I like to push the remote start button and they about jump a mile high, and start looking around.<P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.kdsi.net/~sean" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/seanhsig.gif"> <BR>Sean's Fiero Page</A><BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8 Auto<BR>Going on to 3.4 in Jan.||||reg||1
